Usage: $0 <action> [options]

Actions:
    install <version>               Install Node.js
    update [<version>]              Update the version specified, or all versions otherwise
    remove <versions>               Remove Node.js
    manage <version>                Start managing a version
    unmanage <version>              Stop managing a version
    pkg_add <version> <package>     Add package to the specified version. Package should be valid npm syntax (E.g. pm2, pm2@7, etc.)
    pkg_del <version> <package>     Remove package from specified version. The package should only include the name, not the version
    list                            List Node.js versions
    help                            Show this help
    dump_config                     Dump global configuration variables

EOF

    show_global_options
}

